    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d74-a8">

                <pb facs="0215" n="119" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg119"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure H.—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mackenna to Mr. Root</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 12,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor of placing within the
                    knowledge of your excellency that this Intendencia has unanimously decided to
                    name one of the new streets of Santiago with the name of Root street, (Calle de
                    Root,) in memory and honor of the generous and philanthropic services which your
                    excellency has been pleased to lend to the unhappy sick during the epidemic
                    which has afflicted and yet saddens the city. God guard your excellency.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BEN J, VICUÑA MACKENNA,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Intendente of
                            Santiago.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
